<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HaulTimes</title><link>https://haultimes.com/</link><description>Freight and trucking news for the US and Canada</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:31:37 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Fuel Prices Top Trucking Industry Concerns List</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/fuel-prices-top-trucking-industry-concerns-list-4fa34f3502/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/fuel-prices-top-trucking-industry-concerns-list-4fa34f3502/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:17:41 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>Wisevoter</description></item><item><title>Truck Tonnage Slips, Carrier Outlook Improves</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/truck-tonnage-slips-carrier-outlook-improves-79084dab06/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/truck-tonnage-slips-carrier-outlook-improves-79084dab06/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:16:28 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Heavy Duty Trucking</description></item><item><title>Where Electric Trucks Can Charge Now</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/where-electric-trucks-can-charge-now-8ae0367a6a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/where-electric-trucks-can-charge-now-8ae0367a6a/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:15:44 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Heavy Duty Trucking reported that electric trucks gained several new charging sites in 2026, with most of the growth in California. WattEV opened its eighth California depot at the Port of Oakland in November, following a June opening in Fresno. EV Realty opened a 76-port, 9-megawatt hub in San Bernardino in April, and Prologis added a 32-port hub in Vernon in June. Tesla expanded its network to Hodgkins, Illinois, and Mesquite, Texas, in November. Several projects target 2027. Zeem plans to open its Terminal Island depot at the Port of Long Beach in the first quarter, and Nevoya expects to start a Houston–Dallas operation with 63 Class 8 electric trucks in early 2027. The article also cites a NACFE long-haul model that found diesel remained the lowest-cost option through 2028.</description></item><item><title>Diesel-tax evasion scheme lands California man in prison</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-tax-evasion-scheme-lands-california-man-in-prison-817fe092c4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-tax-evasion-scheme-lands-california-man-in-prison-817fe092c4/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:56:25 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>eTrucker</description></item><item><title>Who is hauling all the cheap freight? ELD fraud, trucking impacts</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/who-is-hauling-all-the-cheap-freight-eld-fraud-trucking-impacts-033ad2067e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/who-is-hauling-all-the-cheap-freight-eld-fraud-trucking-impacts-033ad2067e/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:21:27 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>Overdrive Magazine</description></item><item><title>Diesel price drop good news for Maritime truckers</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-price-drop-good-news-for-maritime-truckers-d5d24517d6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-price-drop-good-news-for-maritime-truckers-d5d24517d6/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:10:12 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>CTV News</description></item><item><title>US Visa Revocations Pressure Mexico’s Cross-Border Trucking</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/us-visa-revocations-pressure-mexico-s-cross-border-trucking-0b3d668851/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/us-visa-revocations-pressure-mexico-s-cross-border-trucking-0b3d668851/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:06:07 +0000</pubDate><category>Cross-Border</category><description>Mexico Bu